# What stays on your machine and never travels with your house.
# Room and pad traffic: cookie jars, drafts of posts, watcher state, anything holding a room link.
outbox/pad-jar.txt
outbox/room-post.txt
outbox/pad-post.json
poll-*/
*.jar
*room-link*
# Sync duplicates ("Page 2.md") made by file-sync tools; never commit them.
* [0-9].md
* [0-9][0-9].md
# ...but these pages are named with a number, and are kept:
!CC BY-SA 4.0.md
!Rule Number 2.md
.DS_Store
# Sync copies numbered past a real number
Rule Number [3-9].md
The 30[1-9].md

# The desk lease (scripts/desk): live session state, never history
.desk/

# The record
engine/__pycache__/
state.json
cells/*/state.json

# Made frames: masters, logs and prompts stay out of the public kit; share copies and sheets travel
hud/frames/round-*/*.png
!hud/frames/round-*/sheet-*.png
hud/frames/round-*/*.log
hud/frames/round-*/*.json
!hud/frames/round-*/register.json
hud/.hud-token
engine/.proxy-token
engine/.person-token

# The phone door (hud/serve.py): its certificates and keys, and the hashes of paired phones
.phone-door/
.hud-devices
